   "szText": "To Walk Where Spirits Tread",
   "hLabel": 4062401
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Phase8Description",
   "szText": "The wolf spirit that appeared to me has gone off in the direction of the Deep Forest.",
   "hLabel": 1557588493
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Callback13Header",
   "szText": "Complete the Rite of Reflection",
   "hLabel": 530138074
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Phase38Description",
   "szText": "There are other blood relics out there that still pose a threat to the people of Sanctuary. I should retrieve another one. It seems one was stashed in the Oaken Cavern under Túr Dúlra.",
   "hLabel": 1463121120
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Callback137Header",
   "szText": "Retrieve the {ITEM:S09_QST_Main_03b_AstarothBloodItem} in {WORLD:S09_QST_Main_03_Tur_Dulra}",
   "hLabel": 1579306865
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Phase0Description",
   "szText": "I should check in with Bryona and see if she's found a way to purge Astaroth's blood.",
   "hLabel": 3577478917
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Callback2Header",
   "szText": "Speak with Bryona",
   "hLabel": 514698856
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Phase63Description",
   "szText": "I should return to Cerrigar with the blood relic from Túr Dúlra.",
   "hLabel": 1351728766
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Callback65Header",
   "szText": "Speak with Bryona",
   "hLabel": 1456924097
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Phase73Description",
   "szText": "To prepare for the ritual, Bryona has sent me to complete a druid rite at a shrine east of Cerrigar. She wasn't specific about what I would find there.",
   "hLabel": 2683357183
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Callback78Header",
   "szText": "Complete the Rite of Sacrifice",
   "hLabel": 705130725
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Phase80Description",
   "szText": "The wolf spirit that appeared to me has gone off in the direction of the Umbral Woods.",
   "hLabel": 1551219037
  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Callback86Header",
